#. module: sale_subscription
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale_subscription/models/sale_order_line.py:0
msgid ""
"(*) These recurring products are discounted according to the prorated period "
"from %(start)s to %(end)s"
msgstr ""
"(*) ສິນຄ້າຕໍ່ເນື່ອງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້ຮັບສ່ວນຫຼຸດຕາມອັດຕາສ່ວນໄລຍະເວລາ ແຕ່ %(start)s ຫາ %(end)s"

#. module: sale_subscription
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale_subscription/models/sale_order_line.py:0
msgid ""
"(*) These recurring products are entirely discounted as the next period has "
"not been invoiced yet."
msgstr ""
"(*) ສິນຄ້າຕໍ່ເນື່ອງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້ຮັບສ່ວນຫຼຸດທັງໝົດ ເນື່ອງຈາກງວດຕໍ່ໄປຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ອອກໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້."

#. module: sale_subscription
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale_subscription/models/sale_order_line.py:0
msgid ""
"(*) These recurring products are surcharged according to the prorated period "
"from %(start)s to %(end)s"
msgstr ""
"(*) ສິນຄ້າຕໍ່ເນື່ອງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີການຄິດໄລ່ຄ່າທຳນຽມເພີ່ມ ຕາມອັດຕາສ່ວນໄລຍະເວລາ ແຕ່ %(start)s ຫາ %(end)"
"s"

